<h1 align="center">🌐 TCP Unit Conversion System</h1>

<p align="center">
  A lightweight multithreaded TCP client-server system built in Python for unit conversion using a custom text-based protocol.
</p>

---

### 🧠 Tech Stack

- Python 3.10+
- Standard Library Only (`socket`, `threading`)
- TCP Client–Server Architecture
- Multithreaded Request Handling

---

### 📁 Project Structure

- `Server.py` → TCP server (handles clients via threads)
- `Client.py` → interactive TCP client
- `Tests.py` → automated test suite + error validation

---

### ⚙️ How to Run

#### 🐍 Check Python Version
```bash
python3 --version
